      "text_helper": "Section 4.5.20 \"BSEC HDPL status register (BSEC_HDPLSR)\" in chapter 4 (Boot and security control (BSEC)), RM0486 Rev 4, page 226.",
      "section_content": "Address offset: 0xE94\nReset value: 0x0000 00B4\nSecure privileged read only. Illegal reads return 0, writes are ignored. Reset to 0xB4 on\nbsec_hrst (hot reset).\nWhen coding a value of less than 3, it can be incremented by writing 0x60B166E7 to\nBSEC_HDPLCR.\nBits 31:8 Reserved, must be kept at reset value.\nBits 7:0 HDPL[7:0]: Current HDPL\n0xB4: Level 0\n0x51: Level 1\n0x8A: Level 2\n0x6F: Level 3\nOthers: Undefined",
